  m_Name: Glasshouse Cell Config 4
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  CellName: Glasshouse
  Description: 'Overgrazed - intensity 4 of Glasshouse: two seeds, fifteen grazers and room for
    eighteen plants between every colour. The standard 1200 u cell with its nucleus (~392
    u). No environment and NOTHING planted wild - every plant is an Angler''s seed, cacti at
    1.4x leaf, up to 18 plants between every colour (160 prisms, ~32,928 volume each at
    maturity). 15 tameable tadpoles graze every garden outside the nucleus; 2 omni crystals
    respawn inside it (the scene''s CrystalManager). Frenzy sits 25% above the full arena
    (4,937 prisms, 762,418 volume). Authored by Tools/Build/author_glasshouse_assets.py -
    re-run it rather than hand-editing.'
